# SPECTRAL Premium UX (Phase 3)

## Token discipline

- Use `--store-*` CSS variables and utility classes (`store-text-body`, `store-panel`, `store-btn-primary`) — **never** raw `text-zinc-*`, `border-zinc-*`, or `bg-black/30` on operational surfaces.
- Primary chrome accent: orange `#F97316` (`--store-accent`). Purple reserved for EW/AI module interiors only.
- Panel surfaces: `rounded-xl` for module panels (`store-panel`); inner wells `rounded-lg` (`store-panel-inner`).

## Data typography

- All quantitative fields (km, MHz, %, coordinates, speeds, counts, timestamps): `font-mono tabular-nums`.
- Display headings: `store-display` (Space Grotesk). Body: Inter via `store-text-body`.

## Interaction

- Five-state controls: default, hover, active, focus-visible (orange ring in `globals.css`), disabled.
- Loading: skeleton-first (`PanelSkeleton`, `GlobeSkeleton`, `GridSkeleton`) — avoid spinner-only dead ends.
- Empty routes: use `EmptyState` with primary CTA deep link.

## Shared components (prefer over ad-hoc markup)

| Pattern | Component |
|---------|-----------|
| Module panel | `OpsPanel`, `StorePanel` |
| Spec sheet row | `SpecRow`, `SpecGrid` |
| Confidence | `ConfidenceBadge` |
| Empty module | `EmptyState` |
| Globe loading | `GlobeSkeleton` |

## Prohibited

- `text-zinc-*`, `bg-zinc-*`, `border-zinc-*` in product UI (use store tokens)
- `bg-black/30` panel backgrounds (use `bg-[var(--store-surface-2)]`)
- Mixed panel radius on same tier (`rounded-lg` vs `rounded-2xl` — standardise on `rounded-xl` for panels)
- Generic “Welcome / Get started” copy without operational KPIs
